<p>Grants <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 40%, 60%, 80%, 100%</acronym> protection to you, your golem and other friendly creatures against the elemental damage of your own bombs, and against external elemental damage (fire, cold, lightning and acid) by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 8%, 11%, 14%, 17%.</acronym></p><p>At talent level 5 it also protects against all side effects of your bombs.</p>